          "paragraphs": [
            "60/40 waxed cotton, 10.5 oz, reproofed with paraffin wax. Sheds rain for about an hour, blocks wind outright. Two chest pockets with snap flaps, two hand pockets, corduroy collar. Unlined, so it works from 40°F to 60°F over a flannel.",
            "Waxed cotton isn't fully waterproof; it's water-shedding. It also leaves wax on car seats for the first month. Reproof it once a year and it'll outlast the rest of your closet."
          ],
